{
  "id": "E409",
  "title": "What To Buy for Valentine’s Day",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2020-03-01",
  "synopsis": "Valentine’s Day is coming. But why is Little Zhang worried?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/50409/53194d25410eb9b2d2ece3b5d53698a9f478f1e0.mp3?1582277720",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "买什么呢\n\n小张：情人节礼物真难买！\n小何：我帮你想想。买衣服怎么样？\n小张：好看的衣服太多了。不好选。\n小何：那巧克力怎么样？\n小张：还行吧。但是我不太爱吃巧克力。\n小何：我还以为你要给别人买礼物。原来别人给你买礼物啊。那你着急什么？\n小张：我为我男朋友着急。\n",
    "traditional": "買什麼呢\n\n小張：情人節禮物真難買！\n小何：我幫你想想。買衣服怎麼樣？\n小張：好看的衣服太多了。不好選。\n小何：那巧克力怎麼樣？\n小張：還行吧。但是我不太愛吃巧克力。\n小何：我還以為你要給別人買禮物。原來別人給你買禮物啊。那你著急什麼？\n小張：我為我男朋友著急。\n"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "What to buy"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小张：情人节礼物真难买！",
      "traditional": "小張：情人節禮物真難買！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng qíng rén jié lǐ wù zhēn nán mǎi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: It’s really difficult to buy Valentine’s Day gifts!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小何：我帮你想想。买衣服怎么样？",
      "traditional": "小何：我幫你想想。買衣服怎麼樣？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé wǒ bāng nǐ xiǎng xiǎng mǎi yī fu zěn me yàng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: I’ll help you think of something. How about buying clothes?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小张：好看的衣服太多了。不好选。",
      "traditional": "小張：好看的衣服太多了。不好選。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng hǎo kàn de yī fu tài duō le bù hǎo xuǎn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: There are too many good-looking clothes. It’s difficult to choose."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小何：那巧克力怎么样？",
      "traditional": "小何：那巧克力怎麼樣？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé nà qiǎo kè lì zěn me yàng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: Then how about chocolate?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小张：还行吧。但是我不太爱吃巧克力。",
      "traditional": "小張：還行吧。但是我不太愛吃巧克力。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng hái xíng ba dàn shì wǒ bú tài ài chī qiǎo kè lì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: It’s OK. But I don’t like to eat chocolate that much."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "小何：我还以为你要给别人买礼物。",
      "traditional": "小何：我還以為你要給別人買禮物。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé wǒ hái yǐ wéi nǐ yào gěi bié ren mǎi lǐ wù",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "原来别人给你买礼物啊。那你着急什么？",
      "traditional": "原來別人給你買禮物啊。那你著急什麼？",
      "pinyin": "yuán lái bié ren gěi nǐ mǎi lǐ wù a nà nǐ zháo jí shén me",
      "english": "Little He: I was under the impression that you are buying a gift for someone else."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Turns out that someone else is buying a gift for you. What are you worrying about then?"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "小张：我为我男朋友着急。",
      "traditional": "小張：我為我男朋友著急。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng wǒ wèi wǒ nán péng you zháo jí",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: I’m worried for my boyfriend."
    }
  ],
